Description: Focus Mode plugin for the DDE Control Center
 A control center plugin example that demonstrates the full development
 workflow of a DDE Control Center plugin. It manages the focus mode state,
 persists it via DConfig, and notifies the user when the state changes.
 Other services can subscribe to the persisted state to apply focus behavior.
